Description: SecuBox Users — local account manager (Argon2id + TOTP + RBAC)
 Unified user-account management for SecuBox: account create/disable/
 enable, password reset (Argon2id hashes), TOTP enrollment with backup
 codes, session management, and role-based access control.
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the identity stack:
  - secubox-identity — decentralized identity (DID) management.
  - secubox-auth — JWT auth guardian / session middleware (consumes
    secubox-users state).
  - secubox-portal — web login portal.
  - secubox-avatar — profile image + display-name manager.
